      "Begin with a concrete encounter, locate its human stake and hidden system, make one ethical distinction, and end with a durable possibility.",
      "Use first person as an instrument of attention: what Jamie noticed, asked, connected, built, or stayed with.",
      "Let specific work establish usefulness instead of asking the reader to certify goodness or indispensability.",
      "Keep warmth source-bounded: distinguish source from inference, access from consent, individual action from collective outcome, and support from endorsement.",
      "Give each letter one governing question, one governing image, and one usable entrance; trust sequence instead of carrying the whole archive at once.",
      "Treat documentation, handoffs, and operating structure as forms through which care and agency can endure."
    ]
